      "title": "Final impressions of Vienna: time to go with the (work)flow\u2026",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>So that's ISMB over for another year. The worlds computational biologists are now sleeping off their Austrian wine and Sacher Torte hangovers on flights back home, hopefully inspired and brimming with fresh ideas for the next year. On the whole it seemed a productive and positive meeting, and whilst personal perspectives always differ depending on the tracks attended, there did seem to be several recurring themes.</jats:p>",
